Day 47 of the Claude AI Coding Challenge: Build a Content Intelligence Studio



Today, I built an AI-Powered Content Intelligence Studio using Claude AI—a multi-agent system that reviews, analyzes, and optimizes content before it gets published.

Instead of relying on a single AI response, the platform assembles a team of specialized AI reviewers, each focused on a different aspect of content quality.

1. Meet the AI Review Team

2.🎣 Hook Analyst – Evaluates whether the opening captures attention.

3. ✍️ Copy Editor – Improves clarity, readability, and flow.

4. Platform Expert – Optimizes content for LinkedIn, YouTube, X, blogs, and more.

5. Engagement Reviewer – Suggests ways to increase interaction and audience retention.

6. Brand Reviewer – Ensures consistency with brand voice and messaging.

7. Synthesis Director – Consolidates all insights into one actionable report.



What the studio delivers

✅ Intelligent content scoring

✅ Strengths and improvement opportunities

✅ Stronger hook recommendations

✅ AI-powered content rewrites

✅ Platform-specific optimization tips

✅ Publishing readiness checklist

✅ Comprehensive review report



